#
# Counter-example for the `math:` expression lowering
# (crates/logic/src/physical/lower.rs, MathLoweringError::UnscopedOccurrence): a
# math:VariableExpression root whose single math:VariableOccurrence resolves, through
# math:declaredVariable, to ex:notFreeNotBound — a declaration that is NEITHER bound by
# an enclosing math:BindingExpression (the root has no enclosing binder at all) NOR a
# math:FreeVariableDeclaration. Distinct from
# tests/counter-examples/variable-occurrence-unscoped.ttl (a standalone occurrence with
# NO math:declaredVariable at all — that trips OccurrenceMissingDeclaredVariable, a
# different variant, and is never reached by the lowering in the first place since it
# carries no parent math:VariableExpression root). The authored math:structuralKey lets
# the reasoned-graph gate (check_structural_key_on_rejected_expression) also reach it.
@prefix math: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/math/> .

ex:root a math:VariableExpression ;
    math:variableOccurrence ex:occ ;
    math:structuralKey "not-a-real-digest" .

ex:occ a math:VariableOccurrence ;
    math:declaredVariable ex:notFreeNotBound .

ex:notFreeNotBound a math:VariableDeclaration .
